  <data name="txt_TempPath.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Will be used store decompressed version of all DLCs and the original version
Please use a root location due to windows file lenght limitations. Location  to store any temp file(uncompressed audio, uncompressed Covers).
Expect substantial size e.g. 20GB 1500 songs.
Also requires the subfolders 0_old(imported), 0_broken(not imported), 0_duplicates(not imported cause of real or user controled uplciation), 0_repacked(repacked files by platform), 0_dlcpacks(imported RS1Retail, RS1DLC, or RS2014 Retail packs).</value>
  </data>
  <data name="btn_PopulateDB.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Starts importing CDLC from Importing CDLC Folder. Note depending on Advanced settings it might copy or move the Imported Original CDLC to Temp/0_old or duplicates or broken as per importing logic and user decisions.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="btn_TempPath.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Select a location to store decompressed CDLC, original imported files, duplicates, broken. Note the tool requires/needs/is designed to use the CDCL in their decompressed state (Warning 3000 CDLC might take 70GB)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="chbx_Configurations.ToolTip" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Dropdown listing a set of Saved profiles for Folders to be used in CDCL Management. (leave EMPTY if you want to remove a profile without selecting and loading it first, after you input name in NEW window)</value>
